The location of the 50C road is in the Tonle Sap area of about 150 hectares. This road connects Kampong Chhnang city through Kampong Leng district of Kampong Chhnang province to Stung Sen city of Kampong Thom province. This road also has about 100 drains and 5 bridges that do not affect the movement of fish.
