During the meeting, Mr. Pan Sosak briefed Ms. Tanja Fajon on the recent achievements of Cambodia as the host of the ASEAN Summit and related meetings in 2022, which was attended by many top leaders from Globally.
The Deputy Prime Minister also noted and appreciated the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, who is committed to maintaining political stability, prosperity and macroeconomic stability. She also expressed her intention to pay an official visit to Cambodia and invited Minister Pan Sosak to pay an official visit to Slovenia.
