According to the police, the arrest of the broker took place on the night of March 7, 2023, after residents protested at the "Neak Tep" guesthouse, located in Trapeang Lvea 1 village in Kakap I commune, Khan Por Sen Chey. The above victim is named Tam Chanti, male, 27 years old, unspecified occupation, living in Trapeang Toeng village, Preal commune, Kanhcheach district, Prey Veng province.
