According to the victims, after the brokers who inspired them in the factories and in the villages and there are many provinces in it, but the victims in Saang district, Kandal province is the most More than 50 percent.
According to the victims, the villagers handed over $ 700 in cash to each of them, some for nearly $ 1,000, to buy clothes and other items to live in Korea. The scammer told the 112 victims that they went to work in Korea through the association, but did not specify the name of the association. And there are different courses and there are more exams or Korean language courses.
