Dr. HUN Manet: Under the vision, strategy and skill of Samdech Techo, Cambodia has achieved complete peace and security
(Kampong Speu): Dr. Hun Manet on March 8, 2023 stated that under the leadership, vision, strategy and skill of Samdech Techo, Cambodia has achieved complete peace and security.
Dr. HUN Manet also appreciates and highly appreciates the achievements of the new factory of Sabrina Group, which has been present in Cambodia for the past 25 years. The company's investment decision in Cambodia first began in 1998, when Cambodia had just achieved full peace under the win-win policy of Prime Minister Samdech Techo.
He said that this decision really reflects the spirit of trust in the Royal Government of Cambodia and the spirit of sympathy with the Cambodian people. Indeed, the continued expansion of investment not only demonstrates the company's success, but also underscores the company's involvement in Cambodia's socio-economic development process.
Dr. HUN Manet added that this great and invaluable achievement has been giving real benefits to the whole country in the form of increasing foreign investment, and especially the increase. Good job opportunities to improve the living standards of workers.
He said that due to the significant contribution of the garment sector, the Royal Government always pays attention and gives high priority for supporting the growth of this sector, especially the welfare of workers.
During the Kovid-19 epidemic, garment workers were considered a priority group to be vaccinated first, and for suspended workers, everyone was vaccinated. Receive a stipend of US $ 40 per month from the Royal Government and training to further strengthen the capacity and job opportunities.
In addition, the Royal Government has introduced a number of support measures to assist factories in the sector, such as tax exemptions, streamlining procedures and facilitating the import of raw materials, including duty exemptions. Pay contributions and so on.
According to Dr. Hun Manet, for 2023, the minimum wage for garment workers will increase to $ 200 per month for full-time workers and other benefits such as regular bonuses. , Travel and accommodation allowances, seniority allowances and insurance services of the National Social Security Fund, which provides free health care services.
Dr. HUN Manet emphasized that in the field of employment, the Royal Government, headed by Samdech Techo, has paid attention to three main priority factors, including:
First, job creation by attracting investors from all over the world, striving to maintain an atmosphere of peace, stability and security, along with building key physical infrastructure, as well as developing incentive policies to ensure that Cambodia Is an attractive destination for long-term investment that ensures a stable balance of employment opportunities for people.
Second, maintaining job opportunities by maintaining macroeconomic stability and a harmonious work environment between employees and employers, which are key players in ensuring the growth and prosperity of factories and enterprises.
