(Phnom Penh): Former supporters of the separatist opposition and often attack Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party, known as "Thy Chacha", expressed their happiness after Samdech did not impose his will and gave permission to live with Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Thy Charcha is a Cambodian citizen living in the United States. In the beginning, especially since 2013, Mr. Thychachar was an individual who strongly supported the former CNRP. In addition, on the social network Facebook, he always issued many obscene messages attacking Samdech Techo Hun Sen as well as the Cambodian People's Party.
But recently, he changed his position from attacking Samdech Techo and the Cambodian People's Party to supporting Samdech Techo and the Cambodian People's Party.
