"Now we come together to defend Samdech Techo's peace policy, together to build and develop the country under the leadership of Samdech Techo," he said.
Notably, in recent times, former opposition supporters, both local and foreign, have been shifting from opposition to supporting Samdech Techo and the CPP. They changed their position because they saw that the CPP was trying to build and develop the country in line with what they wanted.
In addition, they are desperate with the opposition leadership that is divided and gradually weakened and has not done anything for the benefit of society as they want.
