General Dr. Neth Savoeun issued 6 guidelines to the units under the General Commission of the National Police for further implementation to ensure security and public order.
(Phnom Penh): General Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police, on the afternoon of March 7, 2023, chaired a meeting to organize the 2023 work of the Ministry of Interior and the General Commission of the National Police and to celebrate the 112nd anniversary. International Women's Day, March 08, 2023.
Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun, Deputy Commissioner General of the National Police, made a brief report and noted that the past achievements of the General Commissioner of the National Police are to maintain peace, ensure political stability, especially internal security, and protect the normal functioning of the institution. Top, including the monarchy.
What stands out is the protection of the ASEAN Summit, the relevant summits and the protection of national political events, the Commune / Sangkat Council elections. In addition, various events organized more than 10,000 times also provide complete security, which makes the national and international public recognize and appreciate the national police force.
According to Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun, following the words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in cracking down on all kinds of gambling crimes, the National Police Force has actively carried out this work by inspecting more than 10,000 suspected targets. And found law enforcement offenses in 305 locations and arrested 752 people and sent them to court. In more than 1,043 cases of gangs cracked down, 2,373 people were arrested and 728 people were sent to court.
After assessing and forecasting the situation, General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, made six recommendations for implementation in 2023, including:
* First: Absolutely protect peace and national security, ensure social stability
* Second: Continue to fight crime, reduce crime, increase warmth, reduce people's fears, including criminal offenses, drugs, fight against human trafficking, women and children in all forms, pay special attention On information technology issues
* Third: Strengthening traffic order and fire. The biggest goal is to reduce the danger, and the priority is to promote education and participation, because the forces can not do it alone, that is, they must cooperate with the relevant institutions and the people.
* Fourth, border work must continue to cooperate with the border guards, protect national sovereignty, especially strengthen the border defense system, increase cooperation in crime prevention, enhance training capacity and strengthen cooperation with neighboring countries.
* Fifth: The work of the police and the administrative post must fully and effectively carry out the work of the police and the community. This work is important because it is an important mechanism to promote the implementation of national policies, villages, communes, and sangkats are safe. In addition, to promote the training of police officers, support and change attitudes in serving the people.
* Sixth: Strengthen the work of command and intervention to be ready to go to the rescue when the incident and control the situation when the incident. In that, a social media monitoring team, a quick reaction team must be set up to respond to the people's requests, while the National Police General Commission has a command center at 117 waiting to receive complaints and inquiries from the people.
