Commentary: The key point in Chinese national governance is to make people's lives prosperous
BEIJING (Reuters) - In March, the Chinese people celebrated a major event in the political life of the party and the state, with both houses of parliament convening. This year marks the first year that China has fully implemented the spirit of the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China, and also the year of changing the mandate of state institutions and the People's Political Consultative Conference throughout China, so it is important to achieve Extensive interest.
Mr. Chea Monirith, President of the Cambodia-China Progress Researchers Association, said that the roadmap set by the Chinese National People's Congress (NPC) has paved the way for China to achieve its economic growth goals after implementing new policies. These 19 measures to control and prevent smallpox are not only conducive to China's development, but also conducive to global development.
International dignitaries generally believe that the political guidelines set by China's bicameral legislature this year will push China to the "highway" in the next stage of development. How will China lead 1.4 billion people on the path to prosperity and prosperity?
The key to national governance is to make people prosperous. At present, China is the world's highest middle-income country, compared to developed countries, GDP and per capita income are still relatively wide. Unbalanced and incomplete development is a key issue hindering China from advancing a strong modern nation-building.
China has now developed a set of ideas, systems, policies and measures that can promote the common prosperity of all peoples and make the results of modernization more beneficial and equitable. To all people.
At the same time, it must be clearly understood that achieving prosperity as a process requires a lot of long-term effort, taking into account the long-term characteristics, difficulties and complexities. Full. It is necessary to adhere to the concept of development on giving priority to the people, holding on to economic construction, which is the core work to make people feel more benefited.
If you have self-confidence, you will be able to travel far. As long as 1.4 billion Chinese people concentrate their mind and body on the goal, it will be able to overcome all obstacles. On the way forward, the Chinese people will pave a broad new future in building the nation's strength and restoring the nation's prosperity.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Encourages the Ministry of Health to Continue to Mobilize Cambodian Scholars with Higher Education Degrees in Health to Teach in Higher Education and Training Institutions (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia Health continues to recruit Cambodian intellectuals with higher degrees and practical experience in the field of health to teach in higher education and training institutions.
Such encouragement was made on the occasion that Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the closing ceremony of the meeting to review the work of the old year and raise the work direction of the new year of the Ministry of Health. The ceremony was held at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh on Tuesday evening, March 7, 2023.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "I would like to encourage the Ministry of Health to continue to recruit Cambodian intellectuals with higher degrees and practical experience in the field of health to teach in higher education and training institutions."
In addition, Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the Ministry of Health to establish a mechanism to encourage professors in the field of health to conduct regular research to sharpen the knowledge, theory and practice to improve the efficiency of health services.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also mentioned that the social support system is a policy tool for reducing poverty or vulnerability and social inequality, as well as protecting human capital and promoting economic growth.
The Prime Minister instructed the Ministry of Health and the Capital-Provincial Administration to continue to enhance cooperation with relevant ministries, institutions and mechanisms to ensure the effective implementation of the Equity Fund Program for Poor Families and the National Social Security Fund for Care. Health.
In particular, ensure that no citizen is denied access to health care due to inability to pay for services by strengthening mechanisms to monitor and evaluate trends in the use of health care services and the operation of equity and fund programs. National Social Security Fund for Health Care. This is an additional emphasis of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged health officials, doctors and all medical staff to pay more attention, especially to prioritize life-saving, above all, by adhering to professional ethics.
