Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of closing the meeting of the Ministry of Health
(Phnom Penh): On Tuesday evening, March 7, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the closing ceremony of the Ministry of Health. The ceremony was held at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a half-hour talk, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen is pleased to invite the closing ceremony of the five-year work conference and the work direction for the next year of the Ministry of Health.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this conference is important to review the work accomplished for 5 years and put out work in the following years, as well as to improve the health care system to be better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised UN agencies, development partners and friendly countries for donating materials, equipment, medical equipment, vaccines, Kovid-19, ambulances, technical and financial assistance to Cambodia. Successfully fight Kovid-19 disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the strength of national economic development depends on the development of qualified human resources and the development of human resources depends on the good health of the people, driven by the provision of good, complete, adequate and efficient health services. Effectively.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has set out a series of strategies to strengthen, expand and improve public health services. Every year, the Royal Government increases the state budget for the social sector, especially the health sector, in order to continuously promote the provision of better health care and medical services.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government recognizes that the increase in affordability and access to equitable health services is an important factor in raising the living standards of people across the country. Poverty and social well-being in line with Cambodia's socio-economic development goals.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Health and relevant authorities to continue to strengthen the health security system to have sufficient capacity at both the national and sub-national levels to respond in a timely and effective manner in monitoring, research, case study and evaluation. Situation as well as enhance the capacity to prevent, reduce risk and post-crisis recovery from infectious diseases or public health emergencies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the improvement of the quality of health services must be done regularly to improve the quality of health care services and other related services to meet the expectations of patients or customers and to increase the trust of the people. On the public health system, it is necessary to strengthen the effectiveness of the mechanism for monitoring and evaluating the quality of services that are currently being implemented.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Ministry of Health must review and organize the development and proper implementation of clinical governance mechanisms in both public and private health facilities to ensure that the health care services provided are in compliance with the standards. Set.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Health to maximize the health service delivery mechanism as well as strengthen the training on health in both hard and soft skills by regularly updating the curriculum to improve professional ethics. This important sector.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the inclusion of soft skills in the curriculum, especially professional ethics in the health sector, is necessary and urgent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged the Ministry of Health to continue to recruit Cambodian intellectuals with higher degrees and practical experience in the field of health to teach in higher education and training institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Ministry of Health must establish a mechanism to encourage professors in the field of health to conduct regular research to sharpen the knowledge, theory and practice to improve the efficiency of health services.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Health to promote and promote food and beverage promotion and education in order to avoid the impact of those foods on people's health, as some foods can cause side effects. Strong to the health and life of the people, which increases the cost of the people and the additional costs of the Royal Government on health.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that after the Khmer Rouge regime, how to eat to be satisfied. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that for now, not only eating well, but also delicious and safe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises health officials to consider the safety of eating because eating today can cause problems in the future. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the current beauticians, if there is another apat, may die.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises experts to prevent Cambodians from becoming drug addicts of any country.
