General knowledge: Scientists say that there are six deceptive moons near the earth
What are the names and shapes of those space objects?
Are they real moons? Many astronomers explain that it is not the moon, nor is it just an asteroid. They take about a year to orbit the sun like the earth, sometimes moving close enough to the earth to form a light gravitational pull with the earth. We can call them false moons or fake stars or thieves.
