NEC Releases Press Release on Documents Meeting on Documents Related to the 7th National Assembly Election, the 1st Election to Select the Newly-Established Municipal / District Councils
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) on March 7, 2023 issued a press release on the results of the decision on some documents related to the 7th National Assembly election. The first election (re-election) to elect the newly formed municipal council and documents related to the election of the composition of the Commune / Sangkat Election Commission (CEC).
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Prach Chan, Chairman of the NEC. After reviewing and discussing each document in detail, the NEC meeting decided to revise the contents of some documents and agreed in principle on those documents, including:
* First, the decision on the establishment of a committee to coordinate the voter education program and disseminate the policies of political parties for the 7th legislative election in 2023.
* Second: Documents for organizing the policy dissemination program of political parties for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023.
* Third: 3 publications for use and dissemination in the 7th National Assembly Election 2023, including:
* Leaflets on official documents for use in the 7th National Assembly election in 2023 * Leaflets on secret, free, fair and transparent elections * Brochures for voter education
* Fourth: Instructions on the election campaign march and leaflet distribution activities in the markets of political parties for the first election (re-election) to elect the Noble City Council, Sampov Poun Municipality in Kandal Province, Udong Province. May Chey, Samaki Monichey district in Kampong Speu province and O'Kreang Senchey district in Kratie province.
* Fifth: Documents related to the voter information card for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023, including:
* Decisions on the production and distribution of voter information * Calendar of distribution of voter information * Sample of voter information * Report form on the distribution of voter information.
* Sixth: Sample ballot forms for use in training election officials and voter education and ballot forms for use in the 7th National Assembly Election 2023.
* 7th: 8 documents related to the election of the composition of the Commune / Sangkat Election Commission for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023.
In the spirit of the meeting, during the coming April, the NEC will select a total of 8,342 Commune / Sangkat Election Commission members nationwide who are short-term contracted officials to serve in the election. Appointed the 7th legislature in 2023.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen has decided to transfer 15 million doses of vaccine that have not yet been delivered to Cambodia to China for distribution to other countries (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has confirmed that Cambodia has decided to transfer Kovid 19 vaccine. 15 million doses that have not been delivered to Cambodia back to China for China to distribute to other countries in need.
The announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made at the closing ceremony of the Ministry of Health on the afternoon of March 7, 2023.
"This morning, I approved the request of HE Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, regarding the transfer of 15 million doses of vaccines to Chinese friends that have not yet been delivered to Cambodia because there are still some left," he said. "In stock of 6 million doses and our injections are declining, if we continue to load another 15 million doses, we will have a hard time."
Samdech thanked all friendly countries for providing medical, medical and financial assistance to Cambodia to fight Kovid 19 in the past. He hopes that the vaccine transferred to China will be distributed by Chinese friends to countries that are short of vaccines.
