Crowded tourists admire the view of sunrise at Angkor Wat
(Siem Reap): In the early morning, a large number of national and international tourists came to sit and watch the sunrise at Angkor Wat, some tourists sat waiting on the bank of the river in front of the temple, some came to sit and seal. Libraries and others wait on the porch near the pond north and south of the temple with this amazing action.
Ms. Yean Dany, 29 years old, a resident of Phnom Penh, was very surprised when she arrived in front of Angkor Wat because she saw a lot of national and international tourists came to watch the sunrise.
She said that although she had visited Angkor Wat many times, this was the first time she and her friends had visited the sunrise here, having to get up and wait since 5 am. The beauty of the sunrise at the top of Angkor Wat reflects the pond shining golden light. She said she was not disappointed that she took the time to watch the sunrise at Angkor Wat.
Garency Fraken, an American, was overjoyed to see the beautiful sunrise at Angkor Wat. This is a long-held dream of her and her family wishing to visit Angkor Wat. She said she arrived in Cambodia immediately (March 4, 2023), the first destination she and her family visited was Angkor Wat, and her next destination was to visit more ancient temples in the Angkor resort.
When visiting the Angkor resort, tourists often spend precious time getting up early in the morning towards Angkor Wat to see the beauty of the top of the tower of Angkor Wat reflected with the golden sun.
