Lt. Gen. Hun Manet urged all candidates to trust their own abilities and knowledge, rather than relying on external factors, because this is a recruitment contest that will become the leader of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in the future.
The General also thanked the Sub-Committee on Organizing the 2023 Officers Recruitment Examination, Phnom Penh Capital Hall and all competent authorities for their active and responsible efforts to ensure the success of the recruitment exam. The officers of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in 2023 can operate accurately, fairly and successfully.
