Please be informed that on the morning of March 5, 2023, the Ministry of National Defense opened the 2023 Royal Cambodian Armed Forces recruitment exam. There were a total of 6,399 candidates in this competition, including 2,998 female candidates who participated in the competition in 4 districts in Phnom Penh.
Candidates will take part in 4 competitions: 1st: 25th Generation Active Officers, 2nd: 13th Infantry Officers, 3rd: 14th Offensive Officers and 4th: Officers. Soldiers, military technical skills.
The exam will be based on physical education, general knowledge and English. In this year's competition, the commission selected 100 25th generation active duty officers, 100 13th generation infantry officers, 150 14th generation alternate officers and 30 military technical officers.
