(Phnom Penh): The Raksmey Khemara Party has issued a statement fully supporting the verdict of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on March 3, 2023 in the trial of Kem Sokha, former President of the Cambodia National Rescue Party, for conspiracy with foreigners. .
