It should be noted that the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on March 3, 2023 sentenced Kem Sokha to 27 years imprisonment under Article 439 and 443 of the Penal Code for conspiracy with foreigners. Of the Kingdom of Cambodia, as well as the complete revocation of the right to vote, the right to stand for election and the right to engage in other political activities in accordance with the provisions of Article 450 of the Penal Code.
