Mr. Kin Phea reminded the ambassadors that the principles of equality, sovereignty of the state, territorial integrity and non-interference in internal affairs must be fully respected. Therefore, the embassies, as well as foreign embassies in Cambodia, must not interfere in the internal affairs of the sovereign state of Cambodia.
