(Kandal): Three cars and the roof of a small house caught fire because a container truck loaded with mosquito repellent collided with two other cars, causing it to overturn and catch fire in the middle of the night at 2 o'clock on the 4th day. March 2023 in front of Koki Market, Koki Village, Koki Commune, Kien Svay District, Kandal Province.
Kandal Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chhoeun Socheat immediately led the provincial fire brigade and Kien Svay district police inspector while the vehicle was on fire. Koki arrived at the scene immediately.
The police officer said that in this intervention, the police used 15 fire trucks from Kandal Provincial Police, 12 from Phnom Penh used 12 trucks, 2 from Borey Peng Huoth used 2 trucks. And a fire truck from Kien Svay district, using 5 water trucks to help put out the fire.
The official also confirmed that this case also caused the fire of the roof of five houses did not spread to the neighbor's house and was completely extinguished at 2:50 p.m.
