Suspect Sik B, 32 years old, current address: Room for rent, Toul Pong Village, Sangkat Choam Chao 1, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh. 7 bullets, 1 AD, 1 holster, 1 motorcycle, black McWave with license plate Phnom Penh 1JV-2940, collecting money at massage parlors in Khan Dangkor, Khan Por Sen Chey and Khan Meanchey.
