(Kampot): To increase people's awareness and contribute to the promotion of security, safety and social welfare, Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, General Secretariat, National Authority for Combating Drugs and Kampot Provincial Drug Control Committee In March 2023, 350 people participated in disseminating the law on drug control to civil servants, the armed forces and students in Chum Kiri district.
