(Phnom Penh): The spokesman of the Senate has announced his full support for the criminal verdict of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court dated March 3, 2023, which decided to convict Mr. Kem Sokha for conspiracy with foreigners or conspiracy with foreigners. According to the provisions of Article 443 of the Penal Code.
The spokesman of the Senate considered that the conviction of the accused Kem Sokha was a guarantee of strictness, transparency, accuracy and justice in accordance with the laws and procedures in force of the Kingdom of Cambodia. By convicting the above cases, it really contributes significantly to ensuring the peace and security of the Cambodian people.
The Senate supports the process of promoting human rights and democracy in Cambodia, which is guaranteed by the Constitution and all applicable laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The Senate also strongly opposes any attempt to use human rights and democracy as an excuse to carry out secret plans conspiring with foreigners to overthrow the legitimate government through color revolutions or other illegal means, which is the most serious danger. Leading to the destruction of national peace, national security, social stability and the well-being of the Cambodian people.
Once again, for the glory of the nation, the Senate is committed and committed to the absolute protection of the peace of the nation forever.
