According to the spokesperson, for March 3, 2023, traffic police nationwide inspected and fined a total of 19,350 vehicles, including 16,134 motorcycles and 3,216 vehicles.
Noted offenses for motorcycles include: drunken helmets, offenses, signs and license plates. In particular, the car includes: seat belts, no license plates, no driver's license, business phones and violations.
