Drunk Chinese man seizes 17 firearms in Meanchey district, seizes two handguns and more than 100 bullets
(Phnom Penh): A Chinese man drank alcohol and fired 17 shots from a condominium in the middle of the night, causing alarm to the people and the authorities. The shooting happened on the night of March 1, 2023, at R&F Condo, Room 107, Street 60m, Prek Ta Kong Village, Chak Angre Leu Sangkat, Meanchey District.
The report of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Office of Minor Criminal Police, obtained by Fresh News on March 3, 2023, states that a few hours after the incident, the specialized office in cooperation with the Meanchey District Police Inspectorate went down. Detained the Chinese national immediately and confiscated two handguns with more than 100 bullets.
Currently, the suspect and the above exhibits have been sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for processing.
