(Siem Reap): Mr. Sok Nareth, Governor of Kralanh District, on March 2, 2023, inspected the Royal Government's irrigation system and water reservoir and met with farmers in Ta An commune who planted seasonal crops. There is also a watermelon crop that he planted after the rainy season rice harvest.
Mr. Skun Sakin, Chairman of Ta An Commune Council, said that Ta An commune is close to Spean Sreng Reservoir and has a maze of irrigation system every year. Watermelon, etc., a total of 210 hectares.
