* First, to increase the development of human capital in the field of culture and ownership of the work of conservation, promotion and development of national culture, especially the creation of new cultural works of art with high attention to face and identity. National in line with legal standards, professional ethics and global standards to increase productivity and potential to compete with regional and international arts and culture.
* Second, to increase creativity and innovation in the development of cultural arts, using new technologies and initiatives to provide a fun experience and / or learn about cultural arts in new and attractive ways for children, youth, women and the elderly. People with disabilities, vulnerable people and tourists.
