* Third: To continue to strengthen the effectiveness of national cultural preservation work, such as construction, heritage, antiquities, ancient sites, inscriptions, manuscripts, ancient knowledge and Khmer traditions, customs, social practices, morals and values of Khmer culture in pagodas and communities, especially in Indigenous communities.
