After this incident, Lt. Gen. Heng Chantheary, Director of the Traffic Police and Public Order Department of the National Police General Commission, called on all drivers, especially those who have to use the expressway before driving on this road to check the technical condition of vehicles. Accurate in water level, engine oil, brake system, power system, air pressure, tires, tires and gasoline.
