Prey Veng people's straw is in the market after the dry season rice harvest (Prey Veng): After the dry season rice harvest and the rest of the straw in the rice fields, there are traders to collect and make the straw market of Prey Veng people who have never There is a market that is being estimated and affordable.
Farmers living in Sangkat Takeo, Prey Veng City, Prey Veng Province said this morning, March 2, 2023, that they are always engaged in farming by harvesting rice to sell for income. Provide for the family as well as the cost of fertilizer, oil and harvest.
After harvesting the dry rice, the straw is sold to traders to buy straw in the field at a price of 50,000 riel per hectare, and most of those traders are from Svay Rieng province, which always collects and sells to resellers. The ones that are used are: to feed the cows and to be processed into other things according to the needs of the users.
Farmers said that in the past, after harvesting the straw, he burned it all or collected it, but most of it was burned to make it easier for the fields to be cultivated again.
In particular, this year, traders came to buy his straw to the field, so it is easy not to burn again and can cause other fires that damage the land, which is also part of the income. Additional items from the sale of straw after the rice harvest.
