Farmers are offered a maximum price of 60 baht per kilogram for raw rubber, 57 baht per kilogram for latex and 23 baht per kilogram for rubber, limited to 25 rai per household. The rubber planter is entitled to 40% of the value, with the owner receiving 60%.
