According to Mr. Ouch Phea, the construction project of the potential product of the Takeo Provincial Administration has been suspended due to the Kovid 19 crisis. However, the provincial governor claimed that he would try to find a suitable location to make it easier for tourists who come to visit or visit Takeo province to miss the lobster and duck eggs.
Please be informed that Takeo is recognized as a province rich in freshwater lobster and duck eggs with delicious taste. Currently, the provincial administration has been promoting the movement of raising livestock, fish, shrimp, both in the community and in the ponds of the people and hatcheries to be more active.
