The United States and the CIA planned another in September 1958 in New York. As Prince Norodom Sihanouk travels to New York to attend a two-day UN meeting, a member of the Cambodian delegation, Slat Pov (Kim Pov), secretly meets with US intelligence. Many times in a hotel room in New York City.
The senior official was a close friend of CIA officer Victor Matsui and also a brother of the traitor Dap Chuon. But later, the secret plan was leaked and the authorities arrested Slat Pov and sentenced him to death on charges of treason.
During the implementation of the above conspiracy scheme, Prince Norodom Sihanouk received secret information about the conspiracy plan in advance, partly from the Chinese and French embassies. It can be said that France is not happy with the presence of the United States, which is arrogant in the territory that has been under its control for almost 100 years, that is why France dared to provide such secret information to Cambodia.
