(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports will celebrate the National Reading Day 2023 under the theme "Reading is the way to the evolution of education" and a three-day book exhibition from March 10 to 12. 2023 at the Institute of Technology of Cambodia.
