On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen gave a speech for about 1 hour and 20 minutes, the following are the main contents:
* As the beginning of the conversation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that with only 65 days left, Cambodia will host the SEA Games and Para Games after waiting for 64 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen noted that at the beginning of 2023, Samdech has awarded a series of diplomas to students. This is a demonstration of the progress of higher education in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had reminded foreign friends not to make a third mistake in Cambodia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that what he reminded foreigners was in the name of a democracy, but supported an illegal coup.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded of their second mistake, being a democracy, but ignoring the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and recognizing that regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that after Samdech reminded this, some leaders of some countries expressed their regret and considered that it was their big mistake.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no success comes from hardship. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that success that comes from adversity is the most valuable success.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the Development Bank for providing funding for the construction of a school building at the Institute of Technology of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates all students who graduated from the Institute of Technology of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that education is a necessity that everyone should do.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some countries may declare Kovid 19 as a common cold. But Cambodia does not declare the disease a common cold and does not drop the protection against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech wants to divert people to raise rare animals. Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends reviewing the law to change the restrictions to encourage peacock breeding.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to check the law to select other rare species to allow people to raise.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that law enforcement should be a little smarter.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to visit Angkor Sankranti.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded officials to think about the problem before calling Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on all political parties to respect the democratic activities of the youth group, the association, the environmental youth group, and all activities that support the Royal Government.
* Environmental youth groups and associations were insulted by parties and individuals when they acted in support of the government after they left and stopped supporting the opposition.
