(Phnom Penh): On the evening of Tuesday, February 28, 2023, Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen received a delegation from the US-ASEAN Business Council to pay a courtesy call and discuss a number of issues related to investment and business in Cambodia. Cambodia.
The meeting took place at the Peace Palace. Please note that the ASEAN-US Business Council delegation has been visiting Cambodia. During this visit, the US-ASEAN Business Council met with relevant ministries and institutions and also met with the private sector to study investment and business in Cambodia. The Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia expects to launch a joint venture project in the middle of this year
Mr. Sou Socheat, Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Securities Regulator of Cambodia, said that the Securities Regulator of Cambodia has been preparing a draft regulation that allows companies to collect cash to invest in various sectors through the project. Joint investment.
He added that the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia will push for the provision of this regulation to be reviewed and approved by the Board of the Non-Banking Financial Services Authority in the near future. Once this regulation is approved, the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia will make it widely publicized to indicate that the company can begin the process of raising cash for investment.
He expects the project to be operational by mid-2023.
Mr. Sou Socheat also said that so far, there are 10 companies licensed as fund managers or intermediaries in the investment project market, and over the years, the company has trained and studied how to How to play a role in the market to make this process smoother.
He said that for joint ventures, all companies that need cash can contact the company that manages the fund or intermediaries so that the company can prepare a plan to collect cash for the company to invest.
He also said that for companies that raise funds for investment without registering with the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, if there is a complaint, the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia will take legal action.
After the establishment of this fund, the fund management company will use this fund and manage it in a joint venture project approved by CCHR. To receive financial benefits or any benefits that may be property rights or benefits for the participating investors. Therefore, investors are the cash contributors to the project and the fund management company is the investor on behalf of the investor.
