(Central): A man, because he was very angry and angry after his sister told him that he was beaten by the Svay Rolum police chief, got angry and got drunk and jumped on a machete on a motorbike. Go to the police station in Svay Rolum commune, causing a surprise.
This incident happened on February 26, 2024 at the point of Svay Rolum Administrative Police Station, Village No. 2, Sangkat Svay Rolum, Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
Prior to the incident, the suspect had been drinking beer and drugs with his two other sisters, causing them to become very drunk. A lion with a machete in his hand, riding a motorbike, entered the Svay Rolum police station and asked the police who tried to beat his sister.
At that time, the suspect used a knife to chase the victim, a deputy chief of the Svay Rolum police station named Suon Leng. Seeing this, the three victims went to fight and grabbed a knife from the suspect, causing the three victims to be injured as described above.
After the incident, the Svay Rolum police arrested him and sent him to the Takhmao City Police Inspectorate to handle the procedure.
The suspect is currently being held in custody at the checkpoint for further proceedings.
There were 3 victims, including:
* First: Suon Leng, 43 years old, resides in the village where the incident took place, Occupation: Deputy Chief of Svay Rolum Post Prevent injuries to the wrist * Third: Name: Khat Sokhen, 40 years old, Residence: Village, Sangkat, Occupation: Deputy Chief of Village No. 3.
