On 22 February 2023, the Bar Council decided to impose disciplinary action on Lawyer Choung Chou-Ngy, ID 300, by reprimanding him in writing in accordance with the provisions of Articles 59 and 63 and Published to the public in accordance with the provisions of Article 65 of the Law on the Statute of Lawyers.
