General Neang Phat chaired a meeting to review the work results in February and set the direction for March 2023 of the Ministry of National Defense
(Phnom Penh): General Neang Phat, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, this morning, February 28, 2023, chaired a meeting to review the work results in February and set the direction for March 2023 of the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia.
The meeting was held at the Ministry of National Defense with the participation of the leaders of the Ministry of National Defense, the General Command and the leaders of subordinate units.
General Chhum Socheat, Secretary of State and Spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense, said that the meeting highly appreciated the performance of the Ministry of National Defense in February, which the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) paid attention to fulfilling its duties. Achieved good results while the situation in the border area was calm, better security and increased good relations and cooperation with neighboring countries.
In this meeting, General Neang Phat emphasized on the plan to conduct the Neak Meas 2023 exercise in March, instructing the units to pay attention to monitor and actively participate in the Neak Meas exercise. With the Chinese People's Liberation Army at the Phnom Chum Sen training area, enjoy the historic event to enhance the quality, capacity, and strengthen the spirit of solidarity and friendship with friendly countries.
The General instructed all institutions and units to celebrate the anniversary of the establishment of the United Front for National Salvation Army, established by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia in the area of Koh Thmor X16, an important event that contributed to the liberation of the nation and the people. People from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
He further noted some of the upcoming events, including those that the army must continue to protect and pay attention to, including:
* In April 2023, there will be a ceremony to cross the Great Monument of the soldiers who sacrificed their lives to liberate the country from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot
* May 2023 will be the 45th anniversary of the establishment of the 125th Battalion of the United Front for National Salvation of Cambodia
* Participate in defending the national election for the 7th mandate of the National Assembly.
