(Phnom Penh): General Neang Phat, Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of National Defense, instructed the units to pay attention to monitor and actively participate in the 2023 Golden Dragon Exercise in March with the Chinese People's Liberation Army. At Phnom Chum Sen training area, enjoy.
General Neang Phat considered the 20th Golden Dragon Exercise 2023 between the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Chinese People's Liberation Army as a historic event to enhance the quality, capacity and strengthen the spirit of solidarity and friendship with friendly countries.
The introduction of General Neang Phat was made on the occasion that the General chaired a meeting to review the work results in February and set the direction for March 2023 of the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia on the morning of 28 February. This year 2023. The meeting was held at the Ministry of National Defense with the participation of the leaders of the Ministry of National Defense, the General Command and the leaders of subordinate units.
This is according to the announcement of General Chhum Socheat, Secretary of State and spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense on Facebook.
The Golden Dragon exercise between the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Chinese People's Liberation Army has been held in Cambodia for the fourth time since 2016, but was halted after an outbreak of 19 Kovid.
