Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of presiding over the celebration of the 11th National Clean City Day
(Phnom Penh): On Monday afternoon, February 27, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the celebration of the 11th National Clean City Day.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's speech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace, political stability, security, and good order today are a solid foundation to support development and progress in all areas and provide great opportunities for building a prosperous future for Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the tourism sector is still an important factor in the national economic growth. In 2022, Cambodia received more than 2.2 million international tourists, an increase of 1059 percent compared to 2022.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia must consider increasing competitive excellence and ensuring sustainable development to meet the latest developments and trends.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Clean City Competition Movement is an evaluation mechanism and a reminder to the local administration, local authorities, the private sector and the people, national and international tourists about the importance of green development by maintaining the balance of development and Preserve the economic, social, cultural and environmental aspects.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the implementation of the Clean City Competition Movement has contributed to reducing the negative impact on the sustainability of natural, cultural, natural and environmental resources in cities and towns, as well as increasing the attractiveness and sustainability of Further develop tourism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the theme "Clean city, good hospitality, Cambodian hosts provide warmth" for the National Day of Clean Cities now clearly reflects that the city is attractive to visit and stay for tourists. Nationally and internationally, it is a clean city with a good environment, ensuring security, safety, good hospitality, friendliness and hostility that provides a warm welcome.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said to increase education to people to understand the value of hygiene and the environment. Not only in urban areas but also in rural areas.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that living hygienically not only beautifies but also helps the health of citizens.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for about 23 years, Cambodia has not had gonorrhea after the floods. This is a demonstration of the improvement of people's health through hygienic living.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the launch of the "Cambodia Visit Year 2023" campaign to enhance Cambodia's reputation in the global tourism market and enhance Cambodia's tourism competitiveness.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises to promote green development in cities, districts, capitals and provinces throughout the country in accordance with the Royal Government's national development policy and strategy, and to promote the development of urban master plans, including urban planning, demographics, tourism and the environment. Economic and social.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to continue to develop clean cities connected with smart cities that are economically competitive, attractive, tourism, environmentally sustainable and socially responsible to improve people's quality of life with well-being, safety, security and prosperity. Durability and provide warm hospitality to national and international tourists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends the continued development of urban tourism as an important part of contributing to the promotion of the diversification of Cambodia's tourism sector, which is cultural and natural tourism through the planning of integrated urban tourism development with inter-sectoral and Use technology to help develop smart tourism, such as the "City Tales App" mobile app.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to see hotels and restaurants become market sources for Cambodian agricultural products.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the Ministry of Tourism to include the conditions for the use of Khmer agricultural products for the evaluation of hotels.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Advises to Continue to Promote Sustainable and Sustainable Urban Development and Promote "Tourism as a Local Export" by Increasing Tourism Chain Price Chain Interaction with Relevant Support Sectors Agriculture, handicrafts, creative industries and local production to increase the possibility of sharing the fruits of growth through the development of tourism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises to jointly preserve natural resources, including forests and wildlife to attract tourists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his pleasure that the most beautiful beach club in the world took the initiative of Samdech "Beautiful beach is a beach without plastic" in its evaluation criteria.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the attack on environmental youth who used to support the opposition turned to support the Royal Government is a lack of respect for democratic principles.
