Svay Rieng Provincial Governor Instructs Authorities to Examine and Resolve Citizens' Disputes as Far as possible Out of Court
(Svay Rieng): Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province, instructed the municipal and district authorities to examine and try to resolve the disputes of the people as much as possible outside the court system.
Such instructions of the Governor of Svay Rieng Province were made in the meeting to review the work results for February and the work direction for March 2023 of the provincial administration this morning, February 24, 2023.
The provincial governor expressed his appreciation and thanks to the three armed forces, all relevant authorities for their efforts to better protect the security of the people throughout the province and to continue to prepare security plans for the New Year. New national tradition, one village exhibition, one product and the upcoming Sankrant Svay Rieng 2023 program.
Mr. Men Vibol also set out the following main directions:
* 1: The provincial administration must organize a meeting to summarize the work results of the provincial administration in 2022.
* 2: Municipal-district authorities must strengthen the implementation of effective state management.
* 3: Relevant authorities at all levels must continue to strengthen the implementation of safe villages and communes in their localities.
* 4: Municipal-district authorities must encourage people to be aware of the fire.
* 5: Authorities at all levels must strengthen the prevention of drug trafficking, distribution and use at the local level.
