(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, sends a message of congratulations to General Ke Kim Yan, Deputy Prime Minister and Chairman of the National Authority for Combating Drugs, on the occasion of the success of the 67th birthday celebration.
