Pailin Provincial Governor sets work direction to develop the province to be more prosperous and improve people's livelihood
(Phnom Penh): Through the press conference of the spokesperson of the Royal Government on the morning of February 23, 2023, Ms. Ban Srey Mom, Governor of Pailin Province, presented some work directions that the provincial administration has set out to develop the province. All special sectors improve the living standards of the people.
Ms. Ban Srey Mom emphasized that the Pailin Provincial Administration continues to pay high attention to the development of the province in terms of security, public order, economy, social affairs, environment and many physical infrastructure achievements, especially the improvement of people's living standards. .
She said that the provincial administration has worked hard to find potential products of the province to promote the "Village 1 Product 1" movement to create jobs at the local level, reduce migration, develop knowledge and technology to people, promote Cambodian products in quantity. And the quality responds to market demand as well as can attract tourists.
* Second, to improve the security of political security, public order, and the implementation of the policy of "safe villages, communes, sangkats" for the harmony of the people. Continue to improve political security and security of public order for the 7th National Assembly Election 2023 and implement the activities according to the election calendar of the National Election Committee.
* Third: Promote the implementation of the five-year provincial development plan and the three-year rolling investment program of the provincial council, the implementation of sectoral plans and promote the development of infrastructure projects such as roads, irrigation, education, health to promote the development of better living conditions. Maintain the welfare and poverty reduction of the people.
* Fourth: Continue to plan and accelerate the development of the sector to improve the lives of the following people:
Agricultural development: Promote the provision of agricultural production techniques to farmers to develop and increase productivity through the implementation of the Royal Government's agricultural development policy, promote animal husbandry, aquaculture, agro-industrial crops and continue to develop agricultural communities for agricultural products. Which is the market demand and repair and rehabilitation of canals, irrigation structures to irrigate cultivated land.
Development of handicraft industry: Promoting the implementation of the Royal Government's policy, providing an opportunity to promote a better investment environment with the private sector to invest in Pailin province so that people can have high-middle-income jobs by 2023 and Improve the quality of life.
Strengthen land management: Prepare a land use plan, request to clear land for ownership of the people from the protected area and use a lot of land, Pailin geography, and develop all kinds of infrastructure construction in accordance with the regulations in force.
Development of the service sector and the public sector: Strengthen and expand the provision of administrative services at the provincial, municipal, district, commune and sangkat levels through the OWSO mechanism. Develop a better market for people with quality and affordable prices. Develop the market to have a good environment for people to do business, increase the control of wholesale and retail of all kinds of goods with quality and reasonable prices.
Develop key tourism destinations: Develop eco-tourism sites, cultural and historical sites and develop tourism services, hotels, guesthouses, entertainment services, restaurants ..) to improve tourism products, promote the competition movement, clean city, clean resort, green city.
Development of the social sector: Continue to promote the development of education, health and social work so that the people have better knowledge and welfare for human resources with the potential to participate in socio-economic development and implement various social protection policies of the Royal Government to support People are living a better life.
