(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has provided nine additional guidelines to the Ministry of Interior for work direction in 2023.
The provision of additional guidelines was made on the occasion of Samdech presiding over the closing ceremony of the meeting to summarize the work results of 2022 and the work direction of 2023 of the Ministry of Interior on the afternoon of February 23, 2023.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Officially Appreciates the Leaders of the Ministry of Interior, National Police Force, Civil Administration Officials, Prison Officers of the Ministry of Interior and Sub-National Administration for Their Efforts Must be high to achieve many achievements in 2022. At the same time, Samdech also provided some additional guidelines on the work direction for 2023 of the Ministry of Interior as follows:
First, to continue to strengthen and maintain peace, political stability, territorial integrity, national sovereignty, protection of the King, protection of the constitutional monarchy, and to continue to promote liberal democracy, pluralism, civil liberties and the rule of law in accordance with Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Third, the National Police Force must continue to develop its capacity and enhance cooperation both regionally and internationally in order to prevent and suppress terrorism, transnational crime, technology crime, human trafficking in all its forms and forms. Cross-border offenses of all kinds.
