Please be reminded that the Cambodian People's Party and the NEC have filed a complaint to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court seeking justice after Mr. Son Chhay used rhetoric to attack the Cambodian People's Party and the NEC on the council election. Commune / Sangkat, 5th mandate, 2022, that there was buying and fraudulent ballots.
The Phnom Penh Municipal Court on October 7, 2022, announced the verdicts in both cases of public defamation. In that case, the case was filed by the NEC and the Phnom Penh Municipal Court sentenced Mr. Son Chhay to a fine of 9 million riels.
Separately, the case filed by the Cambodian People's Party was sentenced to a fine of 8 million riels and ordered to pay compensation to the civil party 3 billion riels.
Dissatisfied with this decision, Mr. Son Chhay appealed to the Court of Appeal. On 14 December 2022, the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal upheld the judgment of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court in the public defamation case of Mr. Son Chhay "as valid" but decided to amend the fines and compensation. More mind than ever.
