Lt. Gen. HUN Manet: Appointments, new positions and promotions are decided based on a thorough hierarchy.
(Takeo): Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander of the Land Forces, stated that new appointments and promotions are a decision based on a thorough examination and evaluation by the leadership of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces. The Royal Cambodian Armed Forces according to a clear hierarchy in accordance with the principles in force.
This statement was made on the occasion of Lt. Gen. Hun Manet's participation in the announcement ceremony of the change of position and rank of officers of the Takeo Military Operation Area, Daun Keo City on February 22, 2023.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet confirmed that the new appointments and promotions were made based on the examination and evaluation, as well as the detailed consultation of the leadership of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in a clear hierarchy in accordance with the principles. Effective by making it transparent.
Lt. Gen. HUN Manet would also like to congratulate all officers on the new positions and promotions worthy of the abilities, qualifications, merits and achievements that have worked hard to fulfill the motherland with a sense of responsibility. Some time ago. In particular, this is to provide confidence and opportunities to participate in leading and strengthening the Takeo military operation area in the future.
In addition, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet said that from a personal point of view and experience, the assessment to assign each role and task in the unit must be based on three principles that are catalysts to promote more efficient human resource extraction and Effectiveness:
Second, the principle of transparency: refers to the respect of collective and hierarchical opinions in order to ensure uniformity and results that are synthesized from all angles and from all levels.
Third, the principle of maintaining the interests of the organization as a whole: aims to ensure that all assignments in each case can maintain strong internal unity, high efficiency and promote collective prestige.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet would like to express his appreciation to the leaders at all levels and the soldiers throughout the Takeo Military Operation Area who have worked hard to achieve many achievements and achievements in fulfilling their core duties, professional duties and security cooperation in Along the border and within the geography, ensuring better peace and security for the people, as well as building strong units in all areas.
Lt. Gen. HUN Manet would also like to express his pride in these achievements, which really reflect the strong will, solid internal unity, courage and professional conscience of the leaders and soldiers. Throughout the Takeo military operation area to fulfill the duties of serving the motherland.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet emphasized that these are worthy of an outstanding unit with a history dating back to 1979 and who have been most actively involved in the noble mission for the cause of the nation, the motherland and the people in all eras, even in times of peace. And war.
