(Preah Sihanouk): Police in Sihanoukville arrested one of the two suspects after stealing a balloon to reserve copper in front of an abandoned building on National Road 4. Near the former headquarters of FUNCINPEC Party, Group 11, Village 1, Sangkat 1, Preah Sihanouk Province.
