(Siem Reap): Mr. Tea Seiha, Chairman of Siem Reap Provincial Committee of the Cambodian Red Cross, on February 21, 2023, assigned Mr. Kuch Lina, Vice Chairman of the Branch Committee to distribute humanitarian donations to Ms. Kdob Champey, 33 years old. Kork Chas village, Sor Sorsdom commune, Puok district, Siem Reap province, affected by house fire on February 19, 2023.
On that occasion, Mr. Kuch Lina brought a message from Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, as well as Lol Tea Seiha, Chairman of the Branch Committee, and expressed his deepest condolences to the families of the victims. This is an unexpected disaster and no one wants to experience it, and please encourage all family members, do not despair, continue to strive for family life.
