(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chea Vannak, President of Tbong Khmum Provincial Court and Mr. Long Hok Meng, Prosecutor of the Provincial Court, on February 21, 2023, strongly condemned the three generations of traitors Sam Rainsy who were insulted again. To the King, the highest reverence of the Cambodian people throughout the country.
Mr. Eang Sophalleth, Samdech Techo's personal assistant, said that during the meeting, Mr. Remirio respectfully informed Samdech Techo about his visit and the delegation to Cambodia at this time. Mr. Remirio informed Samdech Techo that this visit is to celebrate 30 years of the mission of the French Development Agency in Cambodia.
Mr. Remirio pointed out that for the past 30 years, the French Development Agency has invested about 1 billion euros for development work in Cambodia. The mission of the French Development Agency focuses on key areas such as culture, Angkor Wat restoration, new temples, water, agriculture and energy, as well as the implementation of the political promise in Paris.
During the meeting, the Director General of the French Development Agency asked for Samdech Techo's advice on the work that the French Development Agency continues to do in Cambodia.
Taking that opportunity, Mr. Remy also informed Samdech Techo about opening a technical branch in Cambodia and increasing aid to Cambodia by helping Cambodia on the electricity network, especially for renewable electricity.
In response, Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested that the French Development Agency continue to assist Cambodia in the priority areas that France is already assisting: human resource development, water development, road and electricity infrastructure.
Samdech Techo also informed Mr. Remy about Cambodia's agricultural policy. Cambodia is promoting the processing of rice for export. In this regard, Samdech Techo Prime Minister mentioned the lack of rice mills and rice warehouses for purchase, processing and processing into rice for export.
Samdech Techo also mentioned about the Cambodian industrial policy that Cambodia wants: the processing industry for processing raw materials that Cambodia already has and the technology industry.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also mentioned the investment law in Cambodia, which is very favorable. In particular, it allows foreign investors to invest 100 percent in Cambodia and also allows the use of foreign currency to pay workers' salaries. In this regard, Samdech Techo encourages French investors to consider the possibility of investing in agriculture and industry in Cambodia.
In response to Samdech Techo's request, Mr. Remy informed Samdech Techo that he had recorded everything that Samdech Techo had indicated and that he would intervene on these issues.
Please note that the French Development Agency has been operating in Cambodia for 30 years on sustainable development.
Since its presence in Cambodia in 1993, AFD has supported Cambodia's development projects with the aim of improving and sustaining them for the benefit of the general population.
AFD-funded investment programs are developed and implemented in partnership with partners that enable Cambodians to access basic services such as strengthening water resources management, contributing to climate change adaptation, and building human resources. And sustainable agricultural development.
