As of February this year, Bakong has more than 8 million indirect users and more than 500,000 direct users.
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Chea Serey, Technical Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, confirmed that as of February 2023, there are more than 500,000 direct users of Bakong e-wallets, while about 8 million indirect users.
Ms. Chea Serey's remarks were made in the announcement of the launch of a link to search for information on the individual Kovid-19 vaccination through the Bakong system on February 20, 2023.
Ms. Chea Serey added that the National Bank of Cambodia (NBC) has been working to promote the use of the pong system in practice by providing links to information on vaccinating Kovid 19 with health, which is also part of the drive to increase the use of pakong users. Because the use of Bakong is not just for payment, customers can use it to monitor their health, such as tracking the date of the Kovid 19 vaccination.
Regarding the financial sector, Ms. Chea Serey stated that in 2023, the financial sector is similar to last year or better than last year due to the favorable situation of fuel prices and inflation, however, Cambodia still faces Uncertainty, such as the Ukraine-Russia war, without knowing what will happen next.
As of September 2022, more than 500,000 customers had used transactions in the Bakong system worth $ 1.2 billion, while the number of direct and indirect transactions was about 2 million.
