Ms. Ing Kantha Phavi: The rate of female civil servants is more than 42%, lower than the target of only 6%
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Ing Kantha Phary, Minister of Women's Affairs and Chairperson of the Cambodian National Council for Women, said that as of 2021, the rate of female civil servants will be 42%, compared to the target of 48% in 2023. In the National Strategic Development Plan and the Sustainable Development Goals of Cambodia.
The rate of female civil servants who will retire in 2022 is 755 out of a total of 1,235 retired civil servants. People with disabilities who work in government institutions account for about 1.2 percent of the total number of civil servants.
