Minister Thong Khon urges increase in package sales to ecotourism community
(Phnom Penh): In order to contribute to the development of eco-tourism and community-based tourism effectively and efficiently, Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, urged tourism operators to increase the sale of tour packages to the ASEAN ecotourism community and communities in Cambodia to tourists. More national-international.
It should be informed that two ecotourism communities in Cambodia have received the ASEAN Ecotourism Standard Award, including the beauty of Koh Han ecotourism community in Stung Treng province and Prey Thom Anlong Thom ecotourism community in Siem Reap province.
Mr. Chuk Chumnor said that according to the assessment of ASEAN, the two ecotourism communities are striving to develop human resources in the community, build infrastructure at the local level, increase new tourism products, improve existing tourism products and be very popular. Tourists.
On that occasion, Minister Thong Khon joined in congratulating the two Cambodian ecotourism communities for receiving the ASEAN Ecotourism Standards Award.
He also requested that development partners, national and international organizations continue to support the development of these five community areas, both technically and financially. In addition, please provide technical and financial support to the Ministry of Tourism and the National Committee for Management and Development of Community Tourism and Ecotourism on the implementation of projects related to ecotourism and community.
