Mr. Eang Sophalleth, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's personal assistant, said that during the meeting, the Ambassador asked for permission from Samdech Techo to use the Khmer language.
Mr. Dominic informed Samdech Techo that he had visited Cambodia in 2010. Compared to then and now, he observed that Cambodia is growing rapidly.
In this meeting, Mr. Dominic informed Samdech Techo that his ambition is behind Cambodia to help Cambodia in the fields of economy, trade, investment, education, finance, infrastructure, renewable energy, environment and other areas in order to expand and strengthen relations between the two countries. The deeper will be the stronger.
