On that occasion, Samdech Techo also confirmed to Mr. Dominic that he wants to have a British University in Cambodia.
Samdech Techo also encouraged more British investment in Cambodia.
Biden pledges new $ 500 million military aid package to Ukraine during surprise visit to Kiev
Kiev: US President Joe Biden announced new military aid to Ukraine during an unannounced visit to the Ukrainian capital on Monday, February 20, signaling solidarity with Kiev ahead of its one-year anniversary. Of the Russian invasion of Ukraine. This is according to the release by the AFP news agency on Monday, February 20, 2023.
The siren rang throughout the Ukrainian capital as Biden visited Kiev for talks with Ukrainian President Vladimir Zhelsky, but there were no reports of Russian missiles or airstrikes.
Zelensky said Biden's visit was the most important sign of support for all Ukrainians.
In particular, Biden said Washington would stand with Ukraine in all situations. The United States is by far the largest military donor to Ukraine defending itself against Russian aggression.
On that occasion, Biden promised that Washington would provide a new $ 500 million military aid package to Kiev, which will be announced this Tuesday, including additional ammunition for a mobile artillery missile system. .
On Monday, US President Joe Biden arrived in Kiev unannounced ahead of the one-year anniversary of Russia's war of aggression in Ukraine. It was Biden's first visit to Kiev since the outbreak of war. In December 2022, Zelensky made his first visit to the United States during the war to Washington.
