The ceremony was held on the morning of February 19, 2023 at the Kratie Provincial Theater with the participation of senators, deputies of Kratie Provincial Constituency, Chairman of Provincial Council, Provincial Governor, Ladies and Gentlemen, National Working Group, Provincial and District Visits. Municipalities, Communes, Sangkats, Ladies and Gentlemen, Party leaders, districts, municipalities and communes, local officials and party youth, a total of nearly 500 participants.
