The handover took place with the participation of the Cambodian delegation led by Mr. HUN Many, Representative of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Ambassador of Cambodia to the United Kingdom and Representative of the Department of Southeast Asia of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Commonwealth of the United Kingdom. Art and Archeology Unit of the London Police Commission and the British Arts Council.
