The Minister also encourages private individuals to museums as well as institutions around the world that are exhibiting and preserving Cambodian artifacts to cooperate with the Royal Government of Cambodia through the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts or through the Cambodian Embassy in the country. Each to return the Khmer cultural heritage.
