Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, explained that in Cambodia, the budget law allows only the Prime Minister and the Minister of Economy and Finance to sign, not even the King. . The President of the Senate, the President of the National Assembly, the Deputy Prime Minister also have no authority to issue orders, that is, they only have the right to propose to the Prime Minister, but may have the right to order the expenditure of the budget allocated by law.
Please be reminded that on the morning of February 13, 2023, the Ministry of Information issued a proclamation announcing the revocation of the broadcasting license of the Cambodian Center for Independent Media (CCIM), which the VOD Broadcasting Control Center, after this newspaper distorted that Mr. Hun Manet is the signatory on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in providing assistance to Turkey.
