Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presiding Over the Presentation of Certificates and Diplomas to Nearly 2,000 Vocational Students and Students of the University of Human Resources
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Monday, February 20, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the handing over ceremony of certificates and diplomas to a total of 1 professional and university students of the University of Human Resources. 946 people, including 1,033 women.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 2 hours, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* As the beginning of the conversation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are only 74 days left until the SEA Games in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really happy with the national journey that has achieved the goal of training human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the University of Human Resources for overcoming all difficulties to participate in human resource training in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the epidemic of Kovid 19 is a social hardship. But unity has enabled Cambodia to overcome the epidemic, opening up a wider society and gathering.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that among the 1.5 million target students for vocational training also include "ancestral professions", including weaving, sculpture, painting and pottery.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that students who need to receive vocational training receive free education and receive a monthly stipend.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech Preah Borom Ratanakoth Norodom Sihanouk took great care of the chefs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that now there is food and it must be delicious and safe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Head of State of Laos will attend the opening of the SEA Games in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for the SEA Games, winning a medal is one thing, but as the host, the competition must be well organized.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on Cambodians across the country to pay attention to hygiene during the Cambodian SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen enjoys a friendly volleyball match between Cambodia and France. Samdech Techo praises the ability of Cambodian players.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the announcement that Hun Manet had signed a grant to Turkey on his behalf was a serious mistake. In particular, it is a serious attack on the leadership of the Royal Government on the management of the national budget.
