Minister of Agriculture instructs student volunteers to pay attention to find out more about rice seed production
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Dith Tina, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on February 17, 2023, met with 211 student volunteers from the Royal University of Agriculture to participate in a project to promote rice seed production and export promotion. Quality rice.
During the ceremony, Minister Dith Tina expressed his congratulations and welcome to the 211 student volunteers, in which he instructed the students to pay attention to understand the work of rice seed production. At the same time, interns must be courageous, intelligent and learn to live with the external context.
