(Phnom Penh): Mr. Tin Norin, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Mines and Energy, said that through the Master Plan for the Development of the Electricity Sector from 2022 to 2040, Cambodia needs a total investment of 11.024 million US dollars for the development of electricity sources and the national grid. .
