(Kep): Senior officials of the Ministry of Agriculture and the Governor of Kep Province have called on all fishermen to stop fishing with illegal fishing gear, and if you do not stop, you can be sentenced to 3 to 5 years when the competent authorities and institutions The court found the offense.
