Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun Reminds Police Officers to Be Good role models for the people in obeying the law
(Kampong Speu): Lieutenant General Chhay Kim Khoeun, Deputy Commissioner General of the National Police, this morning, February 17, 2023, reminded all police officers to be good role models for the people to respect the law, especially the law on road traffic. And drugs.
Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun's remarks were made on the occasion of representing Lt. Gen. Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, at the Closing Ceremony of the Security Forces' Basic Networking Training Course and the Criminal Technical Training Course. Police chief at the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship National Police School.
Speaking on that occasion, Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun joined in congratulating and appreciating all the trainees who completed the training of the security forces to build a secret base network and the criminal technical training course, which achieved good results to strengthen Quality and efficiency of the implementation of the roles and responsibilities of the National Police Force.
Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun also noted the situation to all participants, stating that so far, Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia has maintained peace, stability, social security, no terrorism. . Cambodian law enforcement forces also achieved protection of the ASEAN Summit and related summits, as well as the Commune / Sangkat Council elections.
The Deputy Commissioner of the National Police continued that in 2023, the Cambodian police force in general and in particular the National Police Force has many other important tasks such as the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games and the election of representatives. People of the 7th legislature, which will take place in July 2023.
At the same time, Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun thanked the leaders of the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship National Police School for their efforts in the past with good results, and he advised them to continue their efforts on training. Potential police resources to perform effectively.
Honorary General Hing Bun Heang: Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a great hero who saves and serves the people
(Phnom Penh): Honorary General Dr. Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Chief of Staff of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a true hero of love, saved the country, liberated the lives of the people. Killed during the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, defending the nation, religion, the King, maintaining sovereignty and integrity, surviving to serve the people in all circumstances, never fleeing the people in times of difficulty.
The remarks of His Excellency General Hing Bun Heang were made this morning, February 17, 2023, on the occasion of representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, with Ms. Pen Channy inaugurating the achievements at Wat Po Sattaram, also known as Wat Pochentong. Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
He added that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has struggled to overcome hundreds of obstacles and has sacrificed his life and family to liberate the country from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and seek peace for the people. Real citizens and society throughout the country and promote the development of the country from zero to development in all areas until today.
He also claimed that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, a good leader, led the country on the right path to make the world recognize Cambodia on the international stage, and Samdech Techo is a true hero of Cambodia, the founder of peace, defending the territorial integrity. National ideology does not exchange national sovereignty for foreign interests.
