House fire consumes nearly $ 10,000 in Kambol district
(Phnom Penh): An apartment was set on fire while the owner was not busy shopping outside and locked up, causing the loss of the dowry money that was ready to be handed over to the bride and groom for nearly $ 10,000. .
The incident happened at 8 am on February 16, 2023 in Kob Phluk village, Sangkat Pleung Cheh Roret, Khan Kampoul, Phnom Penh.
The apartment that was set on fire was built of concrete measuring 5 meters x 8 meters with zinc roofing. The owner is Mlou Reaksa, female, 42 years old.
Neighbors said that when the incident happened, they suddenly saw smoke coming from inside the house, which caused a great surprise, and they immediately dug the back door to help put out the fire. Fire.
