(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the closing ceremony of the Public Works and Transport Conference on February 16, 2023. 2022 and 2023 work direction of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
On that occasion, Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth urged the Ministry of Public Works and Transport to continue to work to solve challenges and accelerate some work to contribute to the restoration and promotion of national economic growth.
Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth stated, "I urge the Ministry of Public Works and Transport to continue its efforts to address the challenges and accelerate some of the strategically important work to be completed and in a timely manner to contribute to the restoration and promotion. "National economic recovery to be more effective."
To orient and provide input in line with the Prime Minister's recommendation to turn challenges into opportunities by accelerating in-depth reforms to improve the business environment and strengthen Cambodia's competitiveness, Deputy Prime Minister Aun Moniroth system would like to make some recommendations to the following meetings:
