Eighth: Promote the promotion of road traffic safety and strengthen the implementation of the road traffic law by using the program to deduct driving license points and fines for road traffic offenses on mobile phones to increase participation in respecting the road traffic law and to reduce The rate of traffic accidents should be kept to a minimum.
Ninth: Promote cooperation with relevant ministries and institutions and development partners to expedite the preparation of the law on land transport; Law on Inland Waterway Transport and Ports; Railway Law; Policy; Strategies and relevant legal documents for law enforcement in the field of public works and transport to increase the efficiency of management in all aspects.
