"Vision of the Ministry of Economy and Finance 2030" The first strategic implementation document of the Ministry of Economy has been officially released
"Vision of the Ministry of Economy and Finance 2030" is the first strategic implementation document prepared by the Ministry of Economy and Finance in response to the socio-economic development of Cambodia and the 2030 Strategic Goals of the Royal Government.
By 2030, the Ministry of Economy and Finance will be an institution of excellence, competent, highly professional, active and proactive, clean and honest in fulfilling the core and relevant missions assigned by law and the Royal Government effectively and spiritually. Responsible for contributing to achieve the vision of the Royal Government.
All stakeholders must uphold and strictly implement the "institutional values" of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, which are: professional ethics, proactive spirit, balance, efficiency, effectiveness, innovation and philanthropy at all times; Duties of leaders, staff, as well as civil servants at all levels of the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
