Mr. Sun Chanthol said, "In 2022, Cambodia sold 7,125 of its own special car license plates with a budget of 40 billion riels, about 10 million US dollars to the national budget."
The personal special license plate was officially announced for sale on January 7, 2020. The license plate costs from 2 million riel up to 1 billion riel, but for the auction may be more.
