(Kampong Thom): General Santebandit, Mr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner General, reminded all police forces to pay more attention to their work based on a sense of responsibility.
This warning was made by General Santebandit Neth Savoeun at the inauguration ceremony of the new achievements of Kampong Thom Provincial Police on February 14, 2023. The ceremony was attended by Dr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Chairman of the National Working Group for Kampong Thom Province, and was attended by the Deputy Governor, the Armed Forces, many government officials and philanthropists.
On that occasion, General Santebandit Neth Savoeun stressed that all police forces must be careful not to make mistakes in order to avoid the discipline of superiors.
Gen. Santi Bandith Neth Savoeun said that in the past, a small number of police forces have done wrong work with the people and have posted pictures on social media criticizing and affecting the dignity of the National Police and police officers. Those who commit wrongdoing are disciplined by their superiors.
Gen. Dr. Neth Savoeun also urged the leadership and forces to pay more attention to the work to be done, strengthen the leadership of the force with a sense of responsibility for the performance of duties and responsibilities to be honest with the people, especially Work ordered from the top to the police station in charge and respond to timely intervention.
Gen. Dr. Neth Savoeun Neth also thanked Major General Men Ly, Provincial Police Commissioner of Kampong Thom Province and all the forces for their efforts to build on these achievements, especially the participation of philanthropists who made this achievement happen. In Kampong Thom Provincial Police Commissioner.
