(Banteay Meanchey): A spokesman for the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Court and Prosecutor's Office issued a press release on February 14, 2023, explaining the arrest of a journalist named Ung Thap Reang, alias Barang, living in Samaki Meanchey village. Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province, related to the crime of "fraud".
In a press release obtained by Fresh News, a spokesman for the Banteay Meanchey Provincial Court and Prosecutor stated that Kong Chamroeun, a 57-year-old man, had filed a lawsuit against Ong Thap Reang, alias France, in order to help him escape. Document for flat plan in Borey Duong Chan, located in Samaki Meanchey Village, Sangkat O'Chrov, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
After receiving the money, three months later, Kong Chamroeun asked about the house layout documents, and Ung Thap Reang, also known as French, answered with an excuse and dialed the phone.
According to the Submission Order No. 100 AYK dated 13 February 2023, Ung Thap Reang alias France was charged with "fraud" in Palilei 1 Village, Poipet Sangkat and Kbal Spean 2 Village, O'Chrov Sangkat. Poipet city, Banteay Meanchey province during 2018. Offenses punishable under Articles 377 and 378 of the Penal Code and referred to the investigating judge.
The investigating judge questioned the accused, examined the legal facts, found clues of guilt, and issued a pre-trial detention order to continue the investigation. In connection with the actions of Ung Thap Reang, alias France, it is a criminal offense to be held accountable under the law in force.
