This statement was made by Mr. Sam Sarin, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Som Piseth, Provincial Governor, presiding over the groundbreaking ceremony for the project to repair public roads, paved with granite, pour concrete and mark the parking lot on February 14, 2023 at the beach. Samuth is located in Sangkat Kep, Kep City, Kep Province, with the participation of leaders, government officials, armed forces, authorities, citizens and many stakeholders.
During this period, as the national campaign counts down to 100 days towards the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games, in this historic event, Kep province will also host one event, namely to host the competition. Triathlon During this time, the Kep Provincial Administration is speeding up the improvement of key locations such as the streets, especially the Srey Teuk beach.
According to Mr. Som Piseth, in 2023, Kep will host two major events: the SEA Games and the Sea Festival. In order to make it better and more suitable as a host province, we have redesigned our waterfront venue as a program location by improving and eliminating the negative issues that have arisen over the years. And.
For 2023, the provincial administration has mentioned a number of important projects, including the Srei beach area and the expansion of the beach from Srei point to the horse crab statue, widening the road to the royal palace, and the Srei statue to expand and move into the sea. Add.
Through the continuous implementation of important projects of the province, including the transformation of the beach area, the provincial governor expressed his gratitude to government officials, forces of all kinds, people, especially business people in Kep beach who are willing to sit and talk forever. To reach a highly responsible agreement. Kampong Cham Provincial Governor Introduces 10 Points for the Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport to Continue Work in 2023
(Kampong Cham): In the afternoon of February 14, 2023, in the meeting to review the work of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Kampong Cham Province in 2022 and the direction of 2023, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, introduced 10 points to the unit. Continue to perform tasks in 2023.
The Provincial Governor stated that, along with the achievements that should be proudly achieved in 2022, I would like to give some recommendations to the leadership of the Department and civil servants of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Kampong Cham Province as follows:
* First, the Department must continue to strengthen the construction, rehabilitation, repair, expansion and maintenance of roads, bridges, sewers with quality, aesthetics and safety to participate in reducing poverty and reducing traffic accidents caused by factors. Road users and road factors.
* Second, the department must continue to repair or iron or replace traffic equipment such as traffic signs, traffic signs, safety poles and kilometer poles.
* Thirdly, the department must include in the annual plan of the department and request to be included in the plan of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport to convert all types of paved roads into all kinds of paved roads or reinforced concrete paved roads.
* Fourth: Expand the width of roads and bridges according to the standards of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport on the road network in Kampong Cham province.
* Fifth: Assign professional officers of the department to inspect the technical characteristics and quality of the road, rainwater release system to ensure the quality of the road.
* Sixth, to continue to strengthen the provision of public services and inspect the technical characteristics of vehicles, such as registration, issuance of driver's licenses to citizens in a timely manner.
* 7th: Continue to educate and disseminate the road traffic law and distribute books on traffic law, stickers and banners on traffic safety to help reduce traffic accidents in the province.
* Eighth: Continue to educate and disseminate the law on garages for repairing, processing and assembling vehicles in Kampong Cham province in accordance with the technical standards and specifications set by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport to reduce accidents caused by all types of vehicles. Techniques and elimination of districts, vehicles with technical defects, traffic on the road.
* 9th: To cooperate with local authorities at all levels to educate, disseminate and take immediate action for irregular construction of stalls that violate roadside land.
* 10th: To cooperate with commune / sangkat authorities to educate, guide and take immediate action to the people of the construction site who pour soil to clear the water surface by installing the wrong drainage according to the technical specifications.
