Ms. Khieu Sina made this remark during a meeting with members of Commune / Sangkat Councils of 9 districts, 81 districts, communes and female leaders in Kampong Thom province on February 13, 2023.
Ms. Khieu Sina stated, "In Cambodia, women in decision-making and governance roles include women senators, women parliamentarians, women leaders in government, women as deputy prime ministers, women as ministers, women as auditors of the National Audit Authority, women as secretaries of state." Under-Secretary of State.
She added that if you look at the current Cambodian society is constantly changing and growing, especially in the field of digital and modern technology that provides ease of work as well as working life in the field of digital and technology, this important work can build a reputation and Make a lot of money, but this skill is mostly men and very few women in this work.
