During the inspection, the provincial governor continued to lead the department and Kampot municipal authorities to inspect the park in Kampot city, which will be renovated by dismantling the old corolla and replacing it with marble, as well as planting trees with lighting system. Decorate to make the garden in Kampot beautiful and attractive.
The park improvement project in Kampot city, located in Phum 1 Usaphea, Sangkat Kampong Kandal, will take place from the Old Cloth Market Park to the Neak Pean Roundabout, which will become an attractive theme park. Such as: food street, natural grocery store, music venue, restaurant, night market and equipped with ceiling lights from the garden, as well as parking.
After inspecting the park renovation site in Kampot city, the provincial governor also continued to inspect the progress of the construction of the beach for swimming between the new bridge to the railway bridge that is being prepared.
