In response, General Vong Pisen welcomed and congratulated His Excellency Ou Ono Atuzaki on his appointment as Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of Japan to the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The General informed about the situation in Cambodia from the time of war to the present, and for almost 25 years, Cambodia has had complete peace, political stability and development under the wise leadership of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen. Prime Minister of Cambodia.
