He added that the membership would also help speed up the sale of the insurance, without the need for the registration of identity cards, as the database system has already been verified. In particular, institutions and the private sector that have not yet joined can still continue the normal procedure, but compared to the competition, the delivery of services to customers may be slower than companies that have joined the digital system.
