Minister Khieu Kanharith: The mistake of VOD is a serious professional mistake that affects the honor and prestige of the Royal Government (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Mr. Khieu Kanharith, Minister of Information, came out to confirm that the mistake of VOD is a professional mistake Seriously undermines the honor and prestige of the Royal Government and refuses to amend the provisions of the law on the press.
Mr. Khieu Kanharith said this in the weekly meeting of the leaders of the Ministry of Information with the participation and through the video Zoom this morning, February 13, 2023.
Mr. Khieu Kanharith stated that "the mistake of the VOD press at this time is a serious professional error that violates the honor and prestige of the Royal Government and refuses to amend the provisions of the law on the press."
"Any media outlet that disseminates information that harms any institution, organization or individual is subject to a written explanation and sent to that media outlet or not, but it is relevant," he said. The news that we publish must be broadcast in its entirety. "Otherwise, it could face licensing."
Mr. Khieu Kanharith added that as a matter of principle, the Ministry of Information must act in all media units, not just for VOD, but to practice all unprofessional media, as the full non-disclosure of their content is Any other intention.
He said that if the newspaper published the interpretation, but in the sense of misrepresentation, once published, there will be research to put more burden.
Please be informed that on the morning of February 13, 2023, the Ministry of Information has decided to revoke the official VOD broadcasting license from today. The decision to revoke the license was due to VOD's misconduct in disseminating false information, inciting, slandering and defaming Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Dr. Hun Manet.
Before reaching the Ministry of Information to revoke the VOD license, Samdech Techo Hun Sen gave the media time to apologize for their broadcast error that Hun Manet signed a grant to Turkey on his behalf.
But the newspaper did not apologize. On the evening of February 12, 2023, Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen ordered the Ministry of Information to revoke the VOD radio license and to end broadcasting by 10 am on February 13, 2023.
Dr. Ouk Rabun Meets President of Korea Rural Community Corporation to Strengthen Partnership and Understand Cambodia's Needs for Future Investment Projects
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Ouk Rabun, Minister of Rural Development, paid a courtesy call on Mr. Lee Byung Ho, President of the Korea Rural Community Corporation (KRC) and his colleagues on the morning of February 13, 2023 at the Ministry of Rural Development. Strengthen partnerships in Cambodia and understand Cambodia's needs for future investment projects.
The Minister expressed his warm welcome to the Korean delegation and informed Mr. Lee Byung Ho, President of the Korean Rural Community Corporation, about the efforts of the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, both economically and socially. Social work in rural development.
Regarding rural development, the professor confirmed that the Ministry of Rural Development has been actively contributing to the implementation of the Rectangular Strategy, Phase 4, Legislature 6, 2018-2023, through the launch and implementation of the Rural Development Strategy. 5 2019-2023, setting the main policy objective is to "improve the quality and value of life of rural people in an environmentally economic, social and cultural environment."
At the same time, the Ministry has focused on some important work to improve and improve the economic, social and cultural situation of rural people, reduce poverty and narrow the gap between rural and urban areas to achieve development. Sustainable and civilized by improving the living conditions and improving the living conditions of rural communities.
On that occasion, the Minister thanked the KRC for supporting the Royal Government of Cambodia in the development of socio-economic development, especially for the support of the Ministry of Rural Development in the design and implementation of the project "Development Assistance. "Officially an important partner of the Royal Government as well as the Ministry of Rural Development."
In response, Mr. Lee Byung Ho expressed his gratitude and happiness to the Royal Government of Cambodia as well as the Ministry of Rural Development for its good cooperation with KRC in the past.
He expressed support for the achievements of the Royal Government of Cambodia, especially the development of road infrastructure. He said the Korea Rural Association Corporation is a unit of the Korean government under the control of the Korean Ministry of Agriculture. The KRC has also been studying several official assistance projects for the coming year for further cooperation between the KRC and the government, especially with the Ministry of Rural Development.
