Discover Laos where Samdech Techo Hun Sen visits
(Vientiane): Laos or Laos is one of the 10 countries in ASEAN. On the morning of Monday, February 13, 2023, Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen led a high-level delegation to pay an official visit to Laos.
The visit will last for two days from February 13 to 14 at the invitation of Lao Prime Minister Son Sai Siphandon. So we can all take this opportunity to find out some of the history and key potential that this neighbor of ours has:
In the 19th century, the territory was annexed to the French Protectorate of Indochina. Under French tutelage, Vientiane became the capital of the Lao PDR. Shortly after a Japanese occupation of World War II, Laos declared independence in 1945. Unfortunately, the French Protectorate returned to occupying the territory until 1950. Laos gained full independence in 1954 under a constitutional monarchy.
