Stung Pursat 1 Hydropower Station in Veal Veng District is under construction, which is scheduled to be officially launched by the end of 2026
(Pursat): Mr. Khoy Rida, Governor of Pursat Province, accompanied by the Deputy Governor, leaders of relevant departments around the province, the three Armed Forces and Veal Veng District Administration Officials recently inspected the site. Stung Pursat 1 hydropower plant at the point of crying in Stung Thmey village, Bramoy commune, Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
Speaking on the occasion, Mr. Khoy Rida said that Pursat is a province with a lot of potential waiting for development. The Stung Pursat 1 hydropower project at Chen Yom in Stung Thmey village, Bramoy commune, Veal Veng district, which started in late 2022 by a Chinese and Korean company with a capacity of 80 MW, is scheduled to be officially commissioned in 2026. .
On behalf of the provincial authorities, he expressed his full support that the Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has decided to build more for use in the province and can be distributed to other provinces in order to ensure security. Energy in the province reduces the import of electricity from abroad.
