House fire in Poipet city, Banteay Meanchey province, provincial governor led the intervention force
(Banteay Meanchey): There was a case of house fire in O'Chrov village, Sangkat Krong Poipet, Banteay Meanchey province at 5:00 am on February 13, 2023, Mr. Oum Rath, Governor of Banteay Meanchey, Mr. Keat Hul, Governor of Poipet. Lead the three types of forces and rescue teams, as well as private sector fire trucks to intervene in time.
