Neak Oknha Kith Meng Leads a Delegation of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce to Accompany Samdech Techo Hun Sen on an Official Visit to Laos
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of February 13, 2023, with the permission of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, led a delegation of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce to accompany Samdech Techo Director Minister pays official visit to Lao People's Democratic Republic from 13 to 14 February 2023.
During the official visit, Duke Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, will meet with Mr. Odeth Sovannavong, President of the Lao Chamber of Commerce and Industry, during a business meeting with the Lao Chamber of Commerce and Industry.
The meeting focused on boosting economic ties between the two countries and also exchanged views on opportunities, investment climate and potential sectors.
In addition, a delegation from the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce will attend other business and investment meetings to strengthen and expand business ties as well as business connections between Cambodia and Laos.
