Mr. Mao Samy emphasized that the CPP protects and promotes the interests of the people in the past and in the future to be implemented on a regular basis as follows:
Maintain peace, security, order and social security to ensure the security of the people and the development of the nation.
* Provide public services to citizens with transparency, convenience and trust, continue to apply free of charge on birth registration, marriage registration, death list, provision of residence book, family book and Khmer identity card.
* Continue to avoid taxing family farmland, assist farmers in expanding production and finding markets to sell agricultural products at reasonable prices, allocate and provide land ownership to landless poor families who have complied with social land concessions, and prevented encroachment. All types of state land illegally and continue to provide land to people living and enjoying the location of state land in accordance with the principles set by the state.
* Promote the implementation of the policy of safe villages, communes and sangkats, continue to develop all communes / sangkats to have better roads through regular road maintenance, construction of new roads and improvement of roads from dirt roads to roads. Paved or concrete roads, adequate electricity and water supply, better irrigation and quality telecommunication services.
Strengthen the management of immigrants in accordance with the law in force, promote the prevention and suppression of intrusion, residence and illegal activities of foreigners entering Cambodia.
