* The focal point and the party group go down to the back of the house to visit and receive their request, report to the upper level to solve immediately, plan the action, what do we need to do, plan the action, materials must be available in advance. All stakeholders, including commune chiefs, post chiefs, commune clerks, and village chiefs, must do their best to serve the people.
