Kyodo sources claim that the number of China's nuclear warheads is likely to increase from the current 400 to 550 by 2027 and to 900 by 2035. In November 2022, the Pentagon also estimated an increase in the number of Chinese nuclear warheads, saying that by 2035 China would increase to 1,500.
