(Preah Sihanouk): Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, on the afternoon of February 10, 2023, handed over a 35-meter ladder fire truck to Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin for use in local firefighting operations. .
The fire truck was received by Mr. Kouch Chamroeun from the Japan-Cambodia Association, with Mr. Takahashi Fumiki, former Japanese Ambassador to Cambodia, currently the president of the association.
The Hino fire truck, which was handed over to the Sihanoukville Provincial Police on this occasion, is capable of extinguishing fires up to a height of 13 floors and a ladder to facilitate the completion of firefighting interventions that may occur eventually.
