(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism held a meeting to review the management of tourist information centers to promote and improve the quality of tourism information services in tourist information centers in the capital-provinces to focus on good hospitality in the tourism sector on the occasion of Cambodia. Host the upcoming 2023 SEA Games and ASEAN Pava Games.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Kuch Panhasa, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism and Chairman of the Management Team of the Tourism Information Center on February 10, 2023 at the Ministry of Tourism, with the participation of the Capital-Provincial Administration (Deputy Governor). Directors of the 25 Capital-Provincial Departments of Tourism and relevant officials of the Ministry of Tourism and related private sectors.
After hearing the contents of the report on the progress of the management of the Tourism Information Center in 2022 and the implementation direction for 2023, the meeting discussed some important inputs and obtained the following positive results:
1. Propose additional cooperation from the Capital-Provincial Administration in providing location and management of tourist information centers in accordance with the standards of the Cambodian Tourism Information Center to be effective in serving tourists.
2-Continue to improve the quality of tourist information centers in accordance with the needs of tourists and expand the ability to provide tourist information to visitors more widely in all tourist destinations.
3. Examine additional possibilities for the construction of new tourist information centers or tourist information booths. At the same time, it is necessary to modify and renovate existing tourist information centers in accordance with the standard.
Please be informed that this meeting to strengthen the management of tourism information center is also an important core work implemented in accordance with the roadmap on the restoration and promotion of tourism in Cambodia during and after the Kovid-19 crisis 2020-2025 and policy measures. Promote the internal tourism movement in 2021-2023.
In addition, it is also an orientation towards good hospitality in the tourism sector on the occasion of Cambodia hosting the 32nd SEA Games and the 12th ASEAN Pav Games 2023 in the future.
