He instructed the farmers that the Royal Government has provided rice seeds now to use them properly in accordance with the technical specifications, to avoid using this rice seeds in the wrong way, which leads to loss of seeds, loss of money and time, and to know how to store rice. This variety is good enough to be able to sow in later years.
On that occasion, Mr. Ouch Phea said that the provincial authorities, especially the Royal Government of Cambodia, always pay attention to the well-being of farmers, and when there is a water problem, local officials and leaders of the Royal Government came to visit and monitor. Regularly reported to the head of the Royal Government to ask for rice seeds to be distributed to farmers in a timely manner.
